# ─── Local databases (SQLite dev/test seam — ADR-016) ───────────
# db.py writes catalog.db (and future per-epic tables) locally; the DB is a
# build artifact, never source. Postgres is the prod target (ONTOWIZ_DB_DSN).
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# ─── Tooling reports / generated ────────────────────────────────
.quality-reports/
quality-reports/

# ─── OS / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ─── Repo-specific junk ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code session transcript dumps accidentally left in the tree
*-this-session-is-being-continued-from-a-previous-co.txt
# Windows reserved-name artifact from a stray `> nul` redirect
nul
